iki/Jean-Marie_Albertini \"Jean-Marie Albertini\"","line":27},{"title":"Archives nationales de France","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archives_nationales_de_France \"Archives nationales de France\"","line":33},{"title":"Analyse économique de l'imposition sur la plus-value Immobilière - Commerce Immobilier Patrimoine Finance","target":"http://cipf.fr/2015/03/analyse-economique-de-limposition-sur-la-plus-value-immobiliere/","line":41},{"title":"[archive","target":"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fcipf.fr%2F2015%2F03%2Fanalyse-economique-de-limposition-sur-la-plus-value-immobiliere%2F \"archive sur Wikiwix\"","line":41},{"title":"ISBN","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Standard_Book_Number \"International Standard Book Number\"","line":47},{"title":"OCLC","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_Computer_Library_Center \"Online Computer Library Center\"","line":47},{"title":"2-10-081777-9","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:Ouvrages_de_r%C3%A9f%C3%A9rence/2-10-081777-9 \"Spécial:Ouvrages de référence/2-10-081777-9\"","line":47},{"title":"978-2-10-081777-1","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:Ouvrages_de_r%C3%A9f%C3%A9rence/978-2-10-081777-1 \"Spécial:Ouvrages de référence/978-2-10-081777-1\"","line":47},{"title":"1274117266","target":"https://worldcat.org/fr/title/1274117266","line":47},{"title":"[archive","target":"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ofce.fr%2Fpdf%2Frevue%2F1-69.pdf \"archive sur Wikiwix\"","line":49},{"title":"OFCE","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/OFCE \"OFCE\"","line":49},{"title":"Un certain décalage: Perspectives 1999-2000 pour l’économie mondiale","target":"https://www.ofce.fr/pdf/revue/1-69.pdf","line":49},{"title":"[archive","target":"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsignal.sciencespo-lyon.fr%2Farticle%2F221725%2FFinance-La-mondialisation-s-accelere \"archive sur Wikiwix\"","line":53},{"title":"Alternatives économiques","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alternatives_%C3%A9conomiques \"Alternatives économiques\"","line":53},{"title":"Finance. La mondialisation s'accélère","target":"https://signal.sciencespo-lyon.fr/article/221725/Finance-La-mondialisation-s-accelere","line":53},{"title":"[archive","target":"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.imf.org%2Ffr%2FBlogs%2FArticles%2F2022%2F10%2F05%2Fwage-price-spiral-risks-appear-contained-despite-high-inflation \"archive sur Wikiwix\"","line":55},{"title":"Les risques d’une spirale prix-salaires semblent maîtrisés, malgré une inflation élevée","target":"https://www.imf.org/fr/Blogs/Articles/2022/10/05/wage-price-spiral-risks-appear-contained-despite-high-inflation","line":55},{"title":"[archive","target":"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.latribune.fr%2Feconomie%2Finternational%2Fla-hausse-des-salaires-n-accelere-pas-l-inflation-941674.html \"archive sur Wikiwix\"","line":57},{"title":"La hausse des salaires n'accélère pas l'inflation: À partir d'une étude empirique, des chercheurs du FMI concluent qu'une hausse des salaires ne conduit pas à enclencher une spirale salaires-prix rendant l'inflation incontrôlable. Mais les décideurs politiques préfèrent des mesures transitoires et laisser chaque entreprise mener ses négociations salariales pour s'ajuster à une hausse générale des prix qui, montre l'étude, ne s'installe pas dans la durée.","target":"https://www.latribune.fr/economie/international/la-hausse-des-salaires-n-accelere-pas-l-inflation-941674.html","line":57},{"title":"[archive","target":"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cairn.info%2Frevue-politique-etrangere-2023-4-page-143.htm \"archive sur Wikiwix\"","line":59},{"title":"10.3917/pe.234.0143","target":"https://dx.doi.org/10.3917/pe.234.0143","line":59},{"title":"DOI","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_Object_Identifier \"Digital Object Identifier\"","line":59},{"title":"ISSN","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Standard_Serial_Number \"International Standard Serial Number\"","line":59},{"title":"0032-342X","target":"https://portal.issn.org/resource/issn/0032-342X","line":59},{"title":"lire en ligne","target":"https://www.cairn.info/revue-politique-etrangere-2023-4-page-143.htm","line":59},{"title":"éditions du Seuil","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89ditions_du_Seuil \"Éditions du Seuil\"","line":61},{"title":"Le Capital au XXIe siècle","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Le_Capital_au_XXIe_si%C3%A8cle \"Le Capital au XXIe siècle\"","line":61},{"title":"Thomas Piketty","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Piketty \"Thomas Piketty\"","line":61},{"title":"Piketty 2013","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/","line":63},{"title":"Piketty 2013","target":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/","line":65},{"title":"« voir en ligne »","target":"http://piketty.pse.ens.fr/files/capital21c/pdf/G2.6.pdf","line":67},{"title":"[archive","target":"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpiketty.pse.ens.fr%2Ffiles%2Fcapital21c%2Fpdf%2FG2.6.pdf \"archive sur Wikiwix\"","line":67}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"1ibzpdk","at":1771855348492}},
